    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/708bc3ea02915686d376a2eac646cfc3.avif?t=1754548896\" width=1080 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Based on a true story...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A darkness creeps into the life of a grieving man, twisting his reality.</strong> In <i><strong>FORCE RESTART</strong></i>, a first-person psychological survival horror thriller, explore surreal worlds with mind-bending traversal and haunting storytelling to uncover the secrets of the void \u2014 or be lost to it forever...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/fb622ab2529732ff08410af421059f1d.avif?t=1754548896\" width=1080 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Perspective - </strong>Immerse yourself, up close and personal in a suspenseful, dark tale, packed with twists and turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/cab9c7bafa0cc3c3644327b87ca4d5c8.poster.avif?t=1754548896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/cab9c7bafa0cc3c3644327b87ca4d5c8.webm?t=1754548896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/cab9c7bafa0cc3c3644327b87ca4d5c8.mp4?t=1754548896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Combat - </strong>Collect what you can &amp; use it wisely. Scavenge for supplies, conserve ammo and plan your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/3b04ef0fe9a6a01a0007df6223d0df56.poster.avif?t=1754548896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/3b04ef0fe9a6a01a0007df6223d0df56.webm?t=1754548896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/3b04ef0fe9a6a01a0007df6223d0df56.mp4?t=1754548896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Storytelling &amp; Puzzles</strong> - Every piece tells a story. Uncover the haunting tale through solving puzzles, uncovering memories, cryptic encounters, and much more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/dcb322651fc3e654559df018effb18fd.poster.avif?t=1754548896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/dcb322651fc3e654559df018effb18fd.webm?t=1754548896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/dcb322651fc3e654559df018effb18fd.mp4?t=1754548896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments &amp; Sound Design</strong> - Leveraging the power of Unreal Engine 5, experience high-quality visuals and atmospheric audio soundscapes that bring  shifting worlds to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/1fcca8916c67f251f74cba7e4417cee7.poster.avif?t=1754548896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/1fcca8916c67f251f74cba7e4417cee7.webm?t=1754548896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/1fcca8916c67f251f74cba7e4417cee7.mp4?t=1754548896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
